<view class="page">
  <view class="heading">我的订单</view>
  <view class="intro" wx:if="{{payEnabled}}">支付成功后 24 小时内人工交付电子文档。若长时间未收到交付，请通过小程序内客服或订单页说明联系。</view>
  <view class="intro" wx:else>当前开放服务介绍，在线预约尚未开放。</view>

  <view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="card"><view class="body">加载中…</view></view>

  <view wx:elif="{{empty}}" class="card">
    <view class="body" wx:if="{{payEnabled}}">暂无订单记录。支付成功后订单会出现在这里。</view>
    <view class="body" wx:else>暂无订单记录。在线支付通道尚在开通中，当前只能浏览服务介绍。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card" wx:for="{{orders}}" wx:key="_id">
    <view class="title">{{item.title}}</view>
    <view class="row">订单号：{{item.out_trade_no}}</view>
    <view class="row">金额：¥{{item.amountLabel}}</view>
    <view class="row">状态：{{item.statusLabel}}</view>
    <view class="row" wx:if="{{item.refundedLabel}}">已退金额：¥{{item.refundedLabel}}</view>
    <view class="row" wx:if="{{item.remainingLabel}}">剩余未退：¥{{item.remainingLabel}}（交付暂停）</view>
    <view class="row" wx:if="{{item.refundTimeLabel}}">退款完成时间：{{item.refundTimeLabel}}</view>
    <view class="refund-note" wx:if="{{item.refundNote}}">{{item.refundNote}}</view>
    <view class="row">下单时间：{{item.created_at_label}}</view>
  </view>

  <button wx:if="{{payEnabled}}" class="contact-btn" open-type="contact" session-from="order-delivery">联系客服提交材料</button>

  <view class="note">订单数据仅用于交付与售后核对，不会用于其他用途。</view>
</view>
